Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.38,0:00:21.84,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I love you, Jun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.15,0:00:31.87,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Can I get your response now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.41,0:00:34.31,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,Right after I started high school,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.13,0:00:37.26,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,I made a confession.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.17,0:00:41.73,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,It was, without question, \Na confession of love!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.06,0:00:47.45,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,You're just telling me this {\i1}now{\i0}, Tomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.96,0:00:56.07,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.07,0:00:58.67,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I love you too, best bud!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.67,0:01:01.23,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.23,0:01:05.20,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,This dude doesn't even see me as a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.96,0:01:08.95,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,But I, Aizawa Tomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.48,0:01:12.88,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,am a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.26,0:01:24.02,sign_3603_13_I_Want_to_Be_See,Title,0,0,0,,{\frz4.6\fsp5\pos(330,160)\fad(515,1)}I Want to {\3c&H5A5659&\c&HEBEBEB&}Be {\c&H5A5659&\3c&HEBEBEB&}Seen as a Girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.51,0:01:22.56,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,"I Want to Be Seen as a Girl!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.56,0:01:27.94,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.94,0:01:29.65,sign_3787_16_Aizawa,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(570,45)\fsp4}Aizawa
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:33.32,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Heya, Tomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.65,0:01:36.03,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.24,0:01:39.11,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,This guy, Kubota Junichiro, \Nlives next door to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.11,0:01:43.16,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,so we've hung out together \Na lot since we were little.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.70,0:01:47.04,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,We went to different elementary schools,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.04,0:01:48.46,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,but in middle school...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.46,0:01:51.46,flashback,Tomo,0,0,0,,We can finally walk home together!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.34,0:01:54.67,flashback,Junichiro,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.67,0:01:57.47,flashback,Junichiro,0,0,0,,You're getting a little too \Ncrazy with that skirt!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.47,0:01:59.22,flashback,Junichiro,0,0,0,,What kind of new start are you making?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.22,0:01:59.84,flashback,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.84,0:02:01.51,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,That was when I first realized
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.80,0:02:05.06,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,that Jun thought of me as a guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.31,0:02:08.89,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,We're gonna miss the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.89,0:02:10.23,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Let's move!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.19,0:02:14.65,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.65,0:02:16.32,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,This little...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.53,0:02:20.74,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.12,0:02:21.78,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.78,0:02:24.49,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,By the way, I do karate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.49,0:02:25.74,main,Students,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.99,0:02:26.25,top,Students,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.21,0:02:30.96,sign_5232_39_Uenomizu_High_Sc,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,20)}Uenomizu High School
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.63,0:02:36.67,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,That stupid Jun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.67,0:02:39.63,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Is he gonna treat me like a guy forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.63,0:02:42.55,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You gotta say something \Nto him for me, Misuzu!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.55,0:02:44.10,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Listen, Tomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.10,0:02:48.10,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I'm saying this as someone who's been \Na friend to both of you for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.10,0:02:50.10,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Frankly, you're getting what you deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.31,0:02:50.98,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.98,0:02:53.19,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You only ever play games that boys play.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.19,0:02:56.19,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,In middle school, you even fought \Nwith kids from other schools.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.94,0:02:58.82,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,And while I'm at it...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.82,0:03:02.11,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Even in kindergarten, whenever I asked\N you to play house or dolls,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.57,0:03:04.99,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,you never once played with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.37,0:03:06.99,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,S-Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.29,0:03:10.75,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,At this point, you might as \Nwell just become a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.75,0:03:12.25,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.25,0:03:14.00,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Don't ask me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:19.13,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,What the heck? You're gonna \Ntreat me like a guy, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.13,0:03:21.09,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'd like to, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.55,0:03:25.39,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Unlike Junichiro, I've seen certain things...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.39,0:03:26.81,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,with a woman's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.60,0:03:35.48,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Anyway, your first problem \Nis the way you talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.48,0:03:39.32,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I can't just start \Ntalkin' girly outta nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.32,0:03:41.86,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,For starters, why not try \Nsoftening your tone a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.28,0:03:44.28,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Try being more polite and less blunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.49,0:03:50.33,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Buying lunch from the school store?\N What're you getting?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.33,0:03:52.04,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,D-Do you mean me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.04,0:03:54.75,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Gee, I don't know... Let me think...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.08,0:03:58.09,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Why are you talking like that? \NYou sound like an old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.46,0:03:59.38,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,Old man...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.92,0:04:01.67,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,Old man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.67,0:04:03.59,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,What the hell is your problem?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.59,0:04:05.93,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Huh?! What's {\i1}your{\i0} problem?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.93,0:04:07.18,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Bring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.18,0:04:08.26,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Fine by me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.27,0:04:12.69,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Whoa, wait! Time out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.69,0:04:14.48,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Didn't you just tell me to bring it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.73,0:04:18.07,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I said knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.99,0:04:25.11,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.11,0:04:26.37,main,Goro,0,0,0,,Hey! Tomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.74,0:04:28.45,main,Goro,0,0,0,,What happened to your face?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.91,0:04:30.16,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.79,0:04:33.41,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Got in a fight with Jun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.41,0:04:34.87,main,Goro,0,0,0,,Jun-bo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.87,0:04:38.09,main,Goro,0,0,0,,You didn't lose to him, did you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.09,0:04:39.46,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Like I could win!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.71,0:04:43.30,main,Goro,0,0,0,,Don't be a wuss! You call yourself \Nthe heir to the Aizawa style?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:45.22,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Don't be crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:48.05,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You've been teaching him karate too, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.05,0:04:50.35,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,First of all, I'm a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.35,0:04:53.56,main,Goro,0,0,0,,What'd you say?! Come to the dojo right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.02,0:04:57.10,main,Goro,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beat some guts into you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.10,0:04:59.15,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Shut up, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.15,0:05:03.03,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,This is all because of the \Nstupid way you taught me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.03,0:05:04.24,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,All of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.24,0:05:06.41,main,Goro,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.37,0:05:12.75,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,C'mon, Tomo, I said I was \Nsorry about yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.75,0:05:15.46,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,You're the one who hit me, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.46,0:05:17.00,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Just look at my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.75,0:05:22.92,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,In fact, I feel like you've \Nbeen hitting me a lot lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.92,0:05:26.05,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Hey, c'mon! Talk to me already!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.59,0:05:28.76,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,{\i1}That{\i0} is exactly why!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.68,0:05:33.22,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,To be honest, I still don't really get it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:36.27,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,But I apologize, so don't be mad, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.77,0:05:39.98,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Life's boring when you're not around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.98,0:05:44.23,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I can't stand having you ignore \Nme for another second.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.53,0:05:48.49,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,He's always like this \Nthe day after we fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.49,0:05:50.91,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,What is he trying to do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.08,0:05:53.95,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,F-Fine. I won't ignore you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.95,0:05:54.75,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:58.67,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,You really are the best friend \NI could ask for, Tomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.67,0:06:00.96,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.96,0:06:04.92,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,He seriously doesn't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.42,0:06:07.72,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You know, Tomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.55,0:06:12.14,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You and Junichiro always \Ncome to school together,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.14,0:06:14.81,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,and you're together throughout \Nthe school day too, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.81,0:06:16.27,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.52,0:06:19.94,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,So why am I the one you \Nspend your lunch break with?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.94,0:06:21.36,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Well, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.36,0:06:25.15,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,When a girl and a guy eat lunch \Ntogether, doesn't it look like...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.15,0:06:26.90,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,they're dating or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.90,0:06:28.32,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Do you hear yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.57,0:06:31.20,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,But you'd rather eat lunch with him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.20,0:06:31.95,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.83,0:06:34.12,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Misuzu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.12,0:06:35.79,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.79,0:06:38.87,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,W-Wait, wait! What are you gonna do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.87,0:06:40.79,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,The three of us can just eat together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.79,0:06:43.09,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Not that! Anything but that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.54,0:06:46.67,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You don't mind, do you, Junichiro?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.05,0:06:49.51,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,What are you after, Gundo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.97,0:06:55.10,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Why do I have to eat with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.10,0:06:56.85,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,This isn't what I want, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.35,0:06:59.35,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,This is why I didn't want to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.35,0:07:01.60,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,These two hate each other's guts!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.60,0:07:03.86,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Hey, that fried chicken looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.86,0:07:05.32,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Here, you can have a piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.53,0:07:10.61,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Mm, that's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.32,0:07:15.62,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,What do I do with these chopsticks now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.58,0:07:20.54,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Yo, Kubojun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.87,0:07:22.08,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Hey, Tanabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.08,0:07:25.63,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Be honest. How far have you \Ngotten with Aizawa-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.63,0:07:26.84,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.84,0:07:28.21,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.21,0:07:33.05,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,What else could I mean but that intense \Nsport guys and girls do together?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.05,0:07:35.43,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Intense sport guys and girls do together?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.31,0:07:40.52,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,We've been doing that since we were kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.52,0:07:41.48,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.85,0:07:43.23,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,For real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.44,0:07:46.15,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,She does look like she has \Na p-pretty amazing body!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.57,0:07:51.65,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Tomo's got good feet. \NGood at using them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.65,0:07:52.57,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Her feet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.99,0:07:55.16,main,Tanade,0,0,0,,That's hardcore, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.91,0:08:02.92,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Junichiro was telling some guy that you and \Nhe do an intense co-ed sport together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.92,0:08:04.79,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Intense co-ed sport?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.79,0:08:06.42,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.42,0:08:07.46,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Not that sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.63,0:08:16.01,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Jun, you asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.26,0:08:18.72,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Huh? Where'd that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.27,0:08:24.06,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Whoa... Wait a...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.90,0:08:28.19,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Tanabe-kun, do you have a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.19,0:08:31.03,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Gundo-san? Sure! No problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.61,0:08:33.03,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Huh? I misunderstood?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.28,0:08:36.16,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Yes. Those two aren't dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.57,0:08:39.83,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Junichiro doesn't even see Tomo as a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:40.49,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.79,0:08:42.87,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Even though she's so... awesome?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.87,0:08:45.62,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I agree with you, but you're pure scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.83,0:08:50.21,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Anyway, I get it now. I didn't know \Ntheir relationship was so interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.55,0:08:51.80,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Interesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.09,0:08:56.09,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,There's no way {\i1}both{\i0} of \Nthem feel nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.09,0:08:57.97,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,How can I give them a push?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.97,0:08:59.05,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.93,0:09:01.31,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.31,0:09:04.31,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,You don't want anyone butting in \Non your friends' love story, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.31,0:09:07.90,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You've only known Junichiro since \Nstarting high school, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.90,0:09:09.48,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.48,0:09:11.23,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Then remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.23,0:09:14.78,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who's allowed \Nto play with those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.20,0:09:16.82,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,P-Play?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.62,0:09:30.34,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Oh, you forgot your umbrella, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.84,0:09:32.17,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Gundo...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.38,0:09:34.21,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I have one coming for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.21,0:09:36.13,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I have one coming for me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.13,0:09:38.09,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.55,0:09:40.60,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Does that mean it's a contest?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.60,0:09:41.81,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,It does indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.81,0:09:44.35,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Why are you beside me, \Nanyway? Go over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.35,0:09:46.44,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You really hate me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.23,0:09:50.31,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,The three of us used to play \Ntogether all the time, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.31,0:09:52.40,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Why did things turn out like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.65,0:09:57.82,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Yeah, the three of us did get up \Nto a lot of mischief together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.16,0:10:01.87,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,All the pranks you came \Nup with were so extreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.62,0:10:04.95,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,But I never understood why...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.95,0:10:07.04,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Whenever the grown-ups yelled at us,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.04,0:10:08.92,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,you were never around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:10.71,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Wasn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.13,0:10:14.71,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Why didn't you join any clubs?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.71,0:10:16.51,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You like sports, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.51,0:10:19.64,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I do karate at Tomo's family's dojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.34,0:10:24.31,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Besides, there's no point if boys' clubs\N and girls' clubs are separate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.31,0:10:27.35,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,If I'm not in it with Tomo, \Nit wouldn't be any fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.14,0:10:30.35,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Seriously, what {\i1}is{\i0} your deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.35,0:10:31.31,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,What deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.61,0:10:34.07,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,If Tomo were to get a boyfriend...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.07,0:10:34.86,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.86,0:10:36.82,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,What would happen to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.11,0:10:39.20,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Have you ever imagined it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.20,0:10:43.49,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Tomo cozying up to some guy who \Nisn't you, unbeknownst to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.87,0:10:46.83,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Then, with a red face, she says,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.29,0:10:49.79,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,"There's no one else in \Nthis world that I lo—"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.93,0:11:03.18,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh? What're you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.47,0:11:05.64,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,We both forgot our umbrellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.64,0:11:06.60,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.60,0:11:09.14,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Just leave her and walk home with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.14,0:11:09.89,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.52,0:11:11.98,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Let's walk home together!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.69,0:11:15.52,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Why did you come to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.52,0:11:17.61,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I can't share an umbrella with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.61,0:11:19.28,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,That's what I'm telling you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.28,0:11:20.99,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?! But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.66,0:11:23.53,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Don't ask questions. Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.96,0:11:34.71,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,C'mon, get closer to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.71,0:11:37.09,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I-I'm fine right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.09,0:11:39.42,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,No, you're not. You're getting wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.42,0:11:42.09,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I just came from practice, \Nso I smell sweaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.09,0:11:43.97,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,That's what you're worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.47,0:11:49.73,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,You don't smell bad at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.73,0:11:51.27,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You idiot! Don't sniff me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.52,0:11:54.23,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,In fact, you smell kinda nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.40,0:12:04.28,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Hey! Tomo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.04,0:12:10.08,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Hey, Misuzu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.08,0:12:11.83,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,"Misuzu-chan"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.83,0:12:13.62,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Did you forget your umbrella?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.62,0:12:15.83,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Wanna get under mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.83,0:12:16.59,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You're sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.59,0:12:18.05,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Yeah, totally!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.05,0:12:19.63,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Just me alone, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.63,0:12:21.22,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.26,0:12:24.76,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Thanks. You're pretty nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.02,0:12:37.82,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,What the heck were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.82,0:12:39.23,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Now you're soaking...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.15,0:12:40.99,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,wet...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.45,0:12:48.78,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh? What... Jun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.41,0:12:55.96,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Wh-What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.54,0:12:59.13,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I seriously don't get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.30,0:13:04.97,sign_3603_13_I_Want_to_Be_See,Title,0,0,0,,{\fsp2.5\pos(323,155)\fad(515,1)\frz355.4}A Terrify{\3c&H5A5659&\c&HEBEBEB&}ing {\c&H5A5659&\3c&HEBEBEB&}Challenge
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.46,0:13:03.76,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,"A Terrifying Challenge."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.56,0:13:17.48,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,Aizawa-san is so amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.52,0:13:21.78,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,She's sharp, light on her feet, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.03,0:13:24.82,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,stronger than anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.32,0:13:28.57,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,My goddess has descended \Ninto the karate club!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.20,0:13:34.96,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Misaki-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.96,0:13:37.62,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I got all heated without realizing it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.37,0:13:44.47,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,You're still as strong as ever, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.47,0:13:46.22,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.22,0:13:47.84,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.26,0:13:51.01,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Anyway, are you used to the boys' club now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.01,0:13:53.47,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,It must be tough being the only girl here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.47,0:13:55.06,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.31,0:13:59.06,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,All the other students at my family's \Ndojo are guys, too, so I'm used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.40,0:14:03.73,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,If I'm being honest, I wish I could've had \Nthis much fun with other girls, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.73,0:14:07.91,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Yeah, I bet. If you want to go back, \NI can talk to someone for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.91,0:14:09.41,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I can't go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.70,0:14:13.45,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,In the first match I got into to \Ntest the new students' skills...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.74,0:14:16.66,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I got... a little carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.25,0:14:20.38,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,And after that, nobody \Nwould practice with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.71,0:14:24.59,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,I can see it. Even in the boys' club,\N she's untouchable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.96,0:14:28.26,sign_23856_267_Boys__Karate_Clu,Text,0,0,0,,Boys' Karate Club
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.96,0:14:28.26,sign_23856_267_Boys__Karate_Clu,Text,0,0,0,,{\an9}Girls' Karate Club
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.42,0:14:28.26,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I joined the girls' club for \Na change of surroundings...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.63,0:14:31.68,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,And before I knew it, I was \Nsurrounded by guys again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.26,0:14:34.97,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm just a failure as a girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.97,0:14:37.60,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Th-That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.60,0:14:41.23,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I think... you're a very charming girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.81,0:14:44.23,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,At least, that's how I see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.23,0:14:45.19,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.44,0:14:50.16,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,It's the first time a guy ever \Nsaid something like that to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.53,0:14:54.16,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Please tell me, Senpai! \NWhat about me seems girly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.16,0:14:56.37,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,What should I put more emphasis on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.58,0:15:02.42,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Senpai, you've found my \Nwomanly charm, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.42,0:15:03.13,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.13,0:15:06.80,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,S-S-Sorry! I wasn't looking! \NI didn't find anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.80,0:15:08.17,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Nothing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.17,0:15:09.17,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I knew it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.17,0:15:11.68,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,N-Not that! That's not what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.68,0:15:14.18,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,You have all kinds of charms!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.85,0:15:19.56,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,But I don't think you should try \Nto emphasize just one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.89,0:15:23.56,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want you to change like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:27.90,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,You're plenty charming \Njust the way you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.90,0:15:31.45,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,so I think you can have more \Nconfidence in who you are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.58,0:15:42.83,main,Mifune,0,0,0,,Today's the day we talk to Misaki-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.83,0:15:44.34,main,Ogawa,0,0,0,,Like, here he comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.59,0:15:51.88,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Hey, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.63,0:15:54.55,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Thanks for your help today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.80,0:15:56.26,main,Ogawa,0,0,0,,Like, who the heck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.26,0:15:58.77,main,Mifune,0,0,0,,He's pretty hot, too, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.77,0:16:00.85,main,Ogawa,0,0,0,,Wait, no! "He's" totally not!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.85,0:16:02.56,main,Ogawa,0,0,0,,She's wearing, like, a skirt,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.56,0:16:04.77,main,Ogawa,0,0,0,,and her boobs are, like, huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.77,0:16:06.77,main,Mifune/Ogawa,0,0,0,,Like hell we're gonna let this happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.74,0:16:12.86,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.86,0:16:15.99,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I hear Tomo has a friend \Nin the karate club.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.99,0:16:19.12,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Isn't that normal? \NWhat are you smirking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.12,0:16:20.79,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,A guy friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.04,0:16:26.29,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,What's wrong? That's quite \Nthe face you're making.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.97,0:16:36.47,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Oh, crap. I forgot my English textbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.35,0:16:39.10,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Jun, let me look at yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.10,0:16:39.89,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.02,0:16:42.35,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Hey, Tomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.89,0:16:45.98,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I hear you made a friend \Nin the karate club.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.98,0:16:47.56,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You mean Misaki-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.77,0:16:50.15,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Misaki? And who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.15,0:16:51.82,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,The captain of the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.99,0:16:54.74,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Here's a pic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.53,0:16:57.32,italics,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.66,0:17:02.41,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Are there any girls you're \Ncloser to than Gundo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.41,0:17:04.50,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Nope. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.50,0:17:07.63,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I figured. I hate the thought of it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.17,0:17:11.34,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,How would you feel if she got a boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.96,0:17:16.89,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,If she got so wrapped up in him \Nthat she stopped talking to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.47,0:17:19.93,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I can't even imagine \NMisuzu being like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.31,0:17:22.81,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,But... I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.18,0:17:28.06,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I couldn't complain about it, \Nbut I'd be a little lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.06,0:17:29.27,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.48,0:17:31.44,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Exactly! That's exactly it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.86,0:17:33.74,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.74,0:17:41.74,main,Mifune,0,0,0,,You're Aizawa-san from Class A, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.74,0:17:44.71,main,Mifune,0,0,0,,I'm Mifune from Class B.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.71,0:17:47.37,main,Ogawa,0,0,0,,And, like, I'm Ogawa, also from Class B.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.37,0:17:51.25,main,Mifune,0,0,0,,We wanna talk to you about \Nsomething. Meet us after school.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.25,0:17:53.38,main,Ogawa,0,0,0,,Like, behind the gym!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.76,0:17:59.22,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Doesn't sound like you're hoping \Nto become friends with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.06,0:18:03.35,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I dunno what you're up to,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.35,0:18:06.19,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,but I don't get into half-assed fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.19,0:18:08.69,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Are you really ready for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.69,0:18:09.23,main,Ogawa,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.23,0:18:10.02,main,Mifune,0,0,0,,Figh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.02,0:18:13.19,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I asked you if you're ready for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.48,0:18:15.24,italics,Mifune,0,0,0,,What the heck's her deal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.24,0:18:17.20,italics,Ogawa,0,0,0,,She's, like, scary as hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:20.41,main,Girl Student 1,0,0,0,,You want to know about Aizawa-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.62,0:18:23.08,main,Girl Student 2,0,0,0,,Aizawa-san s-scares me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.37,0:18:25.79,main,Girl Student 2,0,0,0,,I was matched up with her \Nin the karate club,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.79,0:18:28.37,main,Girl Student 2,0,0,0,,and her strength is seriously not human!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.37,0:18:30.79,main,Girl Student 1,0,0,0,,She moved to the boys' club \Nand still hasn't lost a match!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.00,0:18:33.30,main,Girl Student 2,0,0,0,,You're talking about a \Nfight with Aizawa-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.30,0:18:35.26,main,Girl Student 2,0,0,0,,I-I'd die if I fought with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.59,0:18:39.09,italics,Mifune,0,0,0,,Die? Am I... gonna die?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.09,0:18:42.18,main,Ogawa,0,0,0,,We gotta go apologize, like, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.72,0:18:46.64,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,These two girls I don't know picked \Na fight with me outta nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.89,0:18:50.27,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I've never had an actual \Nthrow-down with a girl before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.48,0:18:51.81,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,A throw-down?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.15,0:18:54.78,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You're not planning to \Nfistfight girls, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.78,0:18:57.82,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,C'mon, I'm not {\i1}that{\i0} ruthless!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.82,0:18:59.53,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I'll go easy on 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.53,0:19:03.37,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,High school girls don't \Ncommunicate with their fists.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.66,0:19:07.37,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I know that! But I'm not gonna make \Nnice with girls who pick fights!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.37,0:19:09.67,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take the initiative \Nand settle the score right—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.67,0:19:10.83,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.54,0:19:15.84,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I think they just want to \Nverbally quarrel with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.84,0:19:16.92,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Verbally?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:20.05,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Yes. So you can't just come out swinging.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.05,0:19:23.97,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,If you want to make counterarguments \Nor corrections, use your words.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.97,0:19:24.68,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.93,0:19:26.43,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.43,0:19:27.89,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,No buts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.89,0:19:29.94,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You really are frightening, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.94,0:19:30.64,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,That said...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.94,0:19:35.23,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,If they say anything too out of line, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.23,0:19:38.36,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I'll crush them socially.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.07,0:19:42.11,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,I'd say you're a lot more \Nfrightening than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.16,0:19:48.08,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Well? What is it you wanna say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.08,0:19:51.71,main,Mifune,0,0,0,,I-It's not that big a deal, really...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.71,0:19:53.29,main,Mifune,0,0,0,,So for now...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.29,0:19:56.05,main,Mifune,0,0,0,,Could you drop the fighting stance, at least?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.92,0:19:58.38,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Depends on what you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.76,0:20:05.80,main,Ogawa,0,0,0,,Carefully... Choose your words,\N like, carefully!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.80,0:20:07.93,italics,Mifune,0,0,0,,I wanna go home right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.93,0:20:11.44,main,Mifune,0,0,0,,S-See, there's... well... this guy we like...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.44,0:20:14.15,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,And what's that got to do with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.15,0:20:15.65,main,Mifune,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.19,0:20:18.98,main,Mifune,0,0,0,,The guy we like is Misaki-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.32,0:20:25.53,main,Mifune,0,0,0,,And we saw you being all \Nchummy with him, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.95,0:20:27.87,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,So that's what this was about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.87,0:20:28.45,main,Mifune/Ogawa,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.16,0:20:30.50,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You're saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.50,0:20:36.09,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You came to me for love advice \N'cause I know Senpai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.09,0:20:38.59,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You should've said so from the start!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.84,0:20:41.26,italics,Ogawa,0,0,0,,Huh?! Like, how did this happen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.26,0:20:43.55,italics,Mifune,0,0,0,,And why does she sound so happy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.05,0:20:47.93,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,I never thought my little dream of giving \Nsomeone love advice would come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.93,0:20:51.89,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,A girl who can be relied on in matters \Nof love is truly a girl among girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.98,0:20:57.98,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You want to get closer to Senpai, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.98,0:21:00.15,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,So the first thing you gotta \Ndo is be my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.15,0:21:04.49,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,If you're willing to accept \Nmy help, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.99,0:21:07.20,main,Mifune,0,0,0,,S-Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.66,0:21:09.79,italics,Mifune,0,0,0,,Why do I feel so reassured?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.49,0:21:13.25,italics,Ogawa,0,0,0,,She's, like, so reliable somehow...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.42,0:21:22.30,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Man! I never thought I'd end \Nup giving love advice!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.30,0:21:25.88,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Feels like I'm totally \None of the girls now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.88,0:21:29.26,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Maybe I actually have a \Nton of feminine appeal?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.72,0:21:32.60,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.48,0:21:35.85,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Hey, Tomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.85,0:21:39.86,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Do you know what people called you \Nbehind your back in middle school?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.86,0:21:41.44,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh? No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.78,0:21:43.40,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,The Natural Lady-Killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.65,0:21:46.53,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,What the heck? I've never killed anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.33,0:21:51.95,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Tomo! Let's hit up the school store!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.95,0:21:54.08,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Wait... Hang on, Jun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.08,0:21:55.46,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,All right! What do you wanna eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.46,0:21:56.08,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.17,0:21:59.21,main,Mifune,0,0,0,,She actually {\i1}is{\i0} a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.21,0:22:00.29,main,Ogawa,0,0,0,,Totally a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.79,0:22:03.05,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,Seriously, he's so...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.38,0:22:09.09,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,Just start treating me like a girl already!
